{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set off on a mission beneath the occupied Earth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through alien-infested tunnels, ancient vaults, and vast underground caverns \u2014 each step bringing humanity one step closer to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terram Reduc Protocol challenges you to fight, run, and survive across 17 levels and 5 bonus stages, combining tight platforming with fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed as a solo project under the name Horizont Games, this game is an homage to the classic platformers I grew up playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how you rank among other players worldwide in the <strong>TRP Global Leaderboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scores update live as players complete levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your objective:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect symbol-coded keys, unlock barriers, and uncover the heart of the alien network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts \u2014 every kill matters \u2014 and every run pushes you higher on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Run and jump with the keyboard, aim and shoot with the mouse\u2014intuitive controls that keep you focused on the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/12d1209a10ef07de57374991d102e54a.avif?t=1762363393\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System of Keys:</strong> Find the right keys to let you proceed in the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/1a11fd4c3fc21b3e089db8653cd4eb44.avif?t=1762363393\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Energy Infusions</strong>: Discover boosts and new weapons to enhance your abilities and overpower enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/5e2b80089c9f7c9ae335bcdfb86b62e0.avif?t=1762363393\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battle</strong>: Confront massive alien commander that demand skill, timing, and sharp thinking to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/e7c8ef033290e765a0ae483b3591358e.avif?t=1762363393\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to reclaim Earth, one battle at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342480?t=1762363393","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342480?t=1762363393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/94b35120e56a7f5ae0f57dbbb3f3a2cb5976883b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762363393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/94b35120e56a7f5ae0f57dbbb3f3a2cb5976883b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762363393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3540520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set off on a mission beneath the occupied Earth.<